## 1. Runtime system prompts

| Field | Value | Citation file:line |
|---|---|---|
| RetailOps system prompt | Defines tool-first handling for orders/products/policies, identity and current time; forbids guessing and secret disclosure | [`agent_protocol.py#L11-L60`](../../../agent_protocol.py#L11) |
| General system prompt | Vietnamese general assistant; no RetailOps tools, KB citations or live-fact claims | [`agent_protocol.py#L63-L78`](../../../agent_protocol.py#L63) |
| Prompt selection | `request_mode` selects general versus RetailOps system prompt; scoped tools are inserted into request | [`agent_protocol.py#L359-L389`](../../../agent_protocol.py#L359) |
| Prompt validation | Transcript must start with user/system, tool calls and tool results are validated in sequence | [`agent_protocol.py#L298-L340`](../../../agent_protocol.py#L298) |

## 2. Worker prompt templates

| Worker | Extracted instruction | Citation file:line |
|---|---|---|
| Order | Use order/context tools for owned facts; never use order IDs as product IDs; do not invent missing fields or actions | [`retailops/workflow/subagents/order_agent.py#L7-L50`](../../../retailops/workflow/subagents/order_agent.py#L7) |
| Policy | Use `search_knowledge`; report only returned excerpts with exact `[KB:...]` IDs; empty search is not permission to invent policy | [`retailops/workflow/subagents/policy_agent.py#L5-L10`](../../../retailops/workflow/subagents/policy_agent.py#L5) |
| Witty | Answer a general question in 1–2 short sentences, then pivot naturally to shop; no fabricated live weather | [`retailops/workflow/subagents/witty_agent.py#L12-L22`](../../../retailops/workflow/subagents/witty_agent.py#L12) |
| Dispute | Vietnamese dispute/cancellation prompt instructs proposal-only actions and human approval path | [`retailops/workflow/subagents/dispute_agent.py#L13-L23`](../../../retailops/workflow/subagents/dispute_agent.py#L13) |
| MCP prompt | Server exposes a RetailOps SOP assistant prompt to MCP clients | [`retailops_mcp_server.py#L1324-L1335`](../../../retailops_mcp_server.py#L1324) |

